      ":question/problem": "Compute the following:\n\n| $\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -6 & -1 \\\\ 8 & -6 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -6 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} |  |  |",
